  "question": {
    "text": "If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is the solution of the differential equation, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mi>tan</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, then the maximum value of the function <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math> over <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>R</mi></math> is equal to :"
  },
